        "\"Bobby, my man. Good to see you,\" Yichen, the owner of the Shujing, said. Bobby just nodded and kept his mouth shut. The safest action to take when talking to the Triad, even a retired one. Yichen, or Lee Chen as he liked to be called, would always come by and give Bobby a hug whenever he had to clean and stick a couple hundreds in his pocket. Bobby knew enough to check whether they were real after he left**.** Standing no more than five foot two, Yichen still had great posture. He was wearing a tailored Armani suit and polished loafers. It made him look like a cross between an Italian runway model and a dried-up pixie.",
